    "name":  "BIG LED Filament Bulb Smoked Glass - 4W E27 - T178 - Amber",
    "reference":  "DL4WSM-GW-91188",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThis \u003cb\u003eT178 4W LED filament bulb\u003c/b\u003e with a large \"BIG\" sphere design, made of \u003cstrong\u003esmoked glass\u003c/strong\u003e and with an \u003cstrong\u003eE27 socket\u003c/strong\u003e, is an environmentally friendly choice due to its energy efficiency. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith its attractive modern and elegant design of the filament can recreate a \u003cstrong\u003ewarm and pleasant\u003c/strong\u003e light tone to give an ideal lighting with a retro and vintage touch, you will get to give style to any \u003cstrong\u003einterior decoration\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eSmoked Glass LED Filament Bulb - 4W E27 - Amber\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpt for efficiency and style with our\u003cstrong\u003e 4W E27 Smoked Glass Bulb!\u003c/strong\u003e This smart choice not only illuminates, but also beautifies your home or commercial space with a sleek, modern design. The Smoked Crystal housing blends seamlessly with any style of interior decor.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThis bulb is a versatile solution for a variety of uses:\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- General lighting in homes, offices and commercial establishments.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Decorative lighting in common areas of the home, accenting hallways and stairways, or providing task lighting in office spaces.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Perfect for illuminating reading areas, retail stores and showroom displays.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTransform any environment into a unique and stylish space with these decorative bulbs, ideal for pendant lamps, wall sconces or any fixture with an\u003cstrong\u003e E27 socket\u003c/strong\u003e. Their versatility allows for multiple uses, from being the main source of illumination to becoming a home lamp that provides a special and authentically nostalgic combination.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd best of all, our online store offers you a 3-year warranty on this product - illuminate with efficiency and distinction!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eUses of Smoked Glass LED Filament Bulb - 4W E27 - Amber\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGeneral lighting in homes, offices and commercial establishments.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDecorative lighting in living rooms, bedrooms, dining rooms and other common areas of the home.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAccent lighting in hallways, stairways, closets and other transit areas in the home.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWork lighting in office areas, desks and other workstations.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLighting in reading areas, whether in homes or libraries.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStore and display lighting in stores and showrooms.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn FactorLED we ensure that our products have QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each \u003cstrong\u003eLED\u003c/strong\u003e product.\u003c/p\u003e",
